{"type":"message","id":"c1bdf18d","parentId":"c2dfab6d","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:25:19.180Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"read:0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Heartbeat - 每日交易信号扫描\n\n## 🎯 心跳任务\n\n每次心跳时执行以下检查:\n\n### 1. 信息扫描\n- [ ] 扫描市场新闻 (加密货币/美股/宏观)\n- [ ] 检查财报日历 (今日/明日)\n- [ ] 获取恐惧贪婪指数\n\n### 2. 信号生成\n- [ ] 更新技术面指标\n- [ ] 检查预设品种的信号\n- [ ] 记录新信号到 signals/\n\n### 3. 模拟账户\n- [ ] 更新持仓价格\n- [ ] 计算当日 P&L\n- [ ] 检查止损/止盈是否触发\n\n### 4. 报告生成\n- [ ] 生成每日信号报告 (22:00)\n- [ ] 更新 performance.json\n\n---\n\n## 📅 扫描时间\n\n| 时间 | 任务 | 内容 |\n|------|------|------|\n| 08:00 | 早盘扫描 | 隔夜新闻,亚洲市场 |\n| 12:00 | 午盘扫描 | 午间更新,欧洲开盘 |\n| 18:00 | 晚盘扫描 | 美股盘中,财报更新 |\n| 22:00 | 夜盘扫描 | 收盘数据,每日报告 |\n\n---\n\n## 🔔 触发条件\n\n- 正常扫描: 每4小时\n- 重大事件: 新闻关键词触发\n- 止损触发: 模拟持仓触发止损\n\n---\n\n## 📤 输出\n\n- 信号文件: `signals/YYYY-MM-DD.json`\n- 报告文件: `reports/daily/YYYY-MM-DD.md`\n- 持仓更新: `paper-trading/portfolio.json`\n\n---\n\n*心跳配置版本: 1.0*\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1776115519179}}
{"type":"message","id":"fd4ef5ae","parentId":"c1bdf18d","timestamp":"2026-04-13T21:25:23.425Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I've read the HEARTBEAT.md file. The heartbeat tasks include:\n1. 信息扫描 - market news scanning\n2. 信号生成 - signal generation\n3. 模拟账户 - paper trading account updates\n4. 报告生成 - report generation\n\nThe current time is 05:25 AM (Asia/Shanghai) on Tuesday, April 14th, 2026.\n\nLooking at the scan times:\n- 08:00 - 早盘扫描 (morning scan)\n- 12:00 - 午盘扫描 (noon scan)\n- 18:00 - 晚盘扫描 (evening scan)\n- 22:00 - 夜盘扫描 (night scan)\n\nCurrent time is 05:25 AM, which is before the first scan time of 08:00. According to the heartbeat tasks, the report generation is scheduled for 22:00, so there's nothing that needs attention at this time.\n\nSince it's 05:25 AM and the first scan isn't until 08:00, and there are no urgent tasks, I should reply HEARTBEAT_OK.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"HEARTBEAT_OK"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"coze","model":"auto","usage":{"input":520,"output":235,"cacheRead":18176,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18931,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776115519180}}
{"type":"message","id":"d7918749","parentId":"fd4ef5ae","timestamp":"2026-04-14T00:00:55.115Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"📊 **缠论每日模拟交易报告** — 2026年4月14日\n\n---\n\n## 持仓状态\n\n| 品种 | 方向 | 入场价 | 现价 | 盈亏 | 状态 |\n|------|------|--------|------|------|------|\n| A50 | 多 | 100 | ~101.1 | **+1.1%** | 🟢 持仓盈利 |\n\n**账户概览**: 总权益 $9,877 | 未实现盈亏 +$27.5\n\n---\n\n## 缠论结构分析（多级别）\n\n**日线**: 反弹一笔延续中，4000点为关键压力位\n\n**30分钟**: 中枢震荡格局，V型反转确认支撑有效\n\n**5分钟**: 底背驰后反弹，力度尚可\n\n---\n\n## 操作建议\n\n1️⃣ **A50持仓**: 继续持有，等待日线反弹一笔完成\n\n2️⃣ **止损纪律**: 95不变；跌破99.5考虑减仓\n\n3️⃣ **新仓**: 观望，不开新仓\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 风险提示\n\n- 地缘风险：美军封锁伊朗港口，原油暴涨后回落\n- 4000点若冲击未果，可能形成顶背驰\n- 大级别趋势仍需观察\n\n---\n\n📁 完整报告: `/workspace/projects/workspace/reports/daily/2026-04-14.md`\n\n> 走势终完美，当下跟随 — 李小军"}],"api":"openai-responses","provider":"openclaw","model":"delivery-mirror","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776124855115}}
